event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":92,"item_id":"rs_03b34ddd3a1b649f016aca1095afa081939b1ce7385a1e430d","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Improving task management**\n\nI need to fix some issues with ghost references and draft races. I should ensure stability by merging refreshed keyed renders and updating the row UI function to reuse cached row references. I’ll only update saved values if the tracked row snapshot changes. Hidden cached rows will be managed while allowing for task changes. I also need to optimize updates, making sure that we preserve drafts without unnecessary redraws or poll, ensuring better stability in the task management interface."}

